  "prompt": "For each channel and each UTC day of August 2025 on which the channel had spend in ad_spend_daily, show the channel's spend that day and its 7-day average daily spend: the channel's spend over the 7 calendar days ending on that day, divided by 7, rounded to 2 decimals. A day with no spend gets no row, but inside the 7 days it counts as 0, and the 7 days may reach back into July. Return four columns, in this order: channel_id, spend_date, spend_eur and avg_spend_7d. Return one row for each such channel and day. Any row order is fine.",
